      "title": "Duchess of Sussex ‘deeply distressed’ over child sexual abuse image claims against father",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/oct/23/meghan-duchess-of-sussex-distressed-child-sexual-abuse-image-claims-against-father",
      "description": "<p>Meghan reveals she was made aware of ‘disturbing allegations’ against him in 2018 by Met police</p><p>The Duchess of Sussex has said she is “deeply distressed” over accusations involving child sexual abuse images against her estranged father, Thomas Markle Sr, and revealed she was made aware of “disturbing allegations” against him in 2018 by the Metropolitan police.</p><p>Meghan issued a statement after the Sun newspaper published claims that her half-brother Thomas Markle Jr alleged he had found a stash of images belonging to their father at his former home in the Philippines.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/oct/23/meghan-duchess-of-sussex-distressed-child-sexual-abuse-image-claims-against-father\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-10-23T17:14:16"
    },
    {
      "title": "Met says it shared allegations about Meghan’s father with her but not other forces",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/oct/24/met-admits-it-did-not-pass-on-2019-letter-about-meghan-markle-father-thomas-markle-allegations-",
      "description": "<p>Scotland Yard says it shared letter about Thomas Markle Sr allegations in 2019 but did not pass claims to other agencies</p><p>The Metropolitan police have confirmed they gave a letter to the Duchess of Sussex in 2019 concerning “alleged offending” involving her father, after accusations arose on Friday about Thomas Markle Sr having child sexual abuse images.</p><p>Scotland Yard said it had received a letter in January 2019 making a number of allegations about offending outside Britain.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/oct/24/met-admits-it-did-not-pass-on-2019-letter-about-meghan-markle-father-thomas-markle-allegations-\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-10-24T13:52:58"
    },
    {
      "title": "Meghan Says She Is ‘Distressed’ by Claim Her Father Kept Child Abuse Images",
      "link": "https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/23/world/europe/meghan-markle-father-thomas-child-sexual-abuse.html",
      "description": "The Duchess of Sussex said a 2018 letter to royal protection officers informed her decision to keep her children away from Thomas Markle.",
